000010* USE BEFORE REPORTING: declaratives before a detail line, a
000020* control heading, a control footing (with SUPPRESS PRINTING),
000030* the FINAL footing and the report footing.
000040 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000050 PROGRAM-ID. REPORT3.
000060 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000070 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000080 FILE-CONTROL.
000090     SELECT PRINTF ASSIGN TO "report3.txt"
000100        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000110 DATA DIVISION.
000120 FILE SECTION.
000130 FD PRINTF REPORT IS SALES-RPT.
000140 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000150 01 WS-DEPT        PIC X(6).
000160 01 WS-NAME        PIC X(10).
000170 01 WS-AMT         PIC 9(5)V99.
000180 01 DETAILS-SEEN   PIC 99 VALUE 0.
000190 01 BIG-SALE       PIC X(4).
000200 REPORT SECTION.
000210 RD SALES-RPT
000220    CONTROLS ARE FINAL WS-DEPT
000230    PAGE LIMIT 30 LINES
000240    HEADING 1 FIRST DETAIL 3 LAST DETAIL 26 FOOTING 28.
000250 01 TYPE PAGE HEADING.
000260    05 LINE 1.
000270       10 COLUMN 10 PIC X(19) VALUE "SALES BY DEPARTMENT".
000280 01 DEPT-HEAD TYPE CONTROL HEADING WS-DEPT.
000290    05 LINE PLUS 2.
000300       10 COLUMN 2 PIC X(5) VALUE "DEPT".
000310       10 COLUMN 8 PIC X(6) SOURCE WS-DEPT.
000320 01 DETAIL-LINE TYPE DETAIL.
000330    05 LINE PLUS 1.
000340       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(10) SOURCE WS-NAME.
000350       10 COLUMN 16 PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99 SOURCE WS-AMT.
000360       10 COLUMN 27 PIC X(4) SOURCE BIG-SALE.
000370 01 DEPT-TOTAL TYPE CONTROL FOOTING WS-DEPT.
000380    05 LINE PLUS 1.
000390       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(10) VALUE "DEPT TOTAL".
000400       10 COLUMN 16 PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99 SUM WS-AMT.
000410 01 GRAND-TOTAL TYPE CONTROL FOOTING FINAL.
000420    05 LINE PLUS 2.
000430       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(11) VALUE "GRAND TOTAL".
000440       10 COLUMN 15 PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99 SUM WS-AMT.
000450 01 END-OF-REPORT TYPE REPORT FOOTING.
000460    05 LINE PLUS 2.
000470       10 COLUMN 4 PIC X(13) VALUE "END OF REPORT".
000480 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000490 DECLARATIVES.
000500 BEFORE-DETAIL SECTION.
000510     USE BEFORE REPORTING DETAIL-LINE.
000520 BEFORE-DETAIL-PARA.
000530     ADD 1 TO DETAILS-SEEN
000540     IF WS-AMT > 150
000550        MOVE "BIG" TO BIG-SALE
000560     ELSE
000570        MOVE SPACES TO BIG-SALE
000580     END-IF
000590     DISPLAY "BEFORE DETAIL " DETAILS-SEEN " " WS-NAME.
000600 BEFORE-HEAD SECTION.
000610     USE BEFORE REPORTING DEPT-HEAD.
000620 BEFORE-HEAD-PARA.
000630     DISPLAY "BEFORE HEADING " WS-DEPT.
000640 BEFORE-TOTAL SECTION.
000650     USE BEFORE REPORTING DEPT-TOTAL.
000660 BEFORE-TOTAL-PARA.
000670     DISPLAY "BEFORE DEPT TOTAL " WS-DEPT
000680     IF WS-DEPT = "ADMIN"
000690        DISPLAY "  (SUPPRESSED)"
000700        SUPPRESS PRINTING
000710     END-IF.
000720 BEFORE-GRAND SECTION.
000730     USE BEFORE REPORTING GRAND-TOTAL.
000740 BEFORE-GRAND-PARA.
000750     DISPLAY "BEFORE GRAND TOTAL".
000760 BEFORE-END SECTION.
000770     USE BEFORE REPORTING END-OF-REPORT.
000780 BEFORE-END-PARA.
000790     DISPLAY "BEFORE REPORT FOOTING".
000800 END DECLARATIVES.
000810 MAIN SECTION.
000820 MAIN-PARA.
000830     OPEN OUTPUT PRINTF
000840     INITIATE SALES-RPT
000850     MOVE "SALES" TO WS-DEPT
000860     MOVE "ADAMS" TO WS-NAME MOVE 100.50 TO WS-AMT
000870     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000880     MOVE "BAKER" TO WS-NAME MOVE 200 TO WS-AMT
000890     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000900     MOVE "ADMIN" TO WS-DEPT
000910     MOVE "CLARK" TO WS-NAME MOVE 50.25 TO WS-AMT
000920     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000930     MOVE "IT" TO WS-DEPT
000940     MOVE "DAVIS" TO WS-NAME MOVE 300 TO WS-AMT
000950     GENERATE DETAIL-LINE
000960     TERMINATE SALES-RPT
000970     DISPLAY "DETAILS SEEN " DETAILS-SEEN
000980     CLOSE PRINTF
000990     STOP RUN.
